---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<p class="eyebrow">Guided by first principles. Tested against reality.</p>
	<h1>A map of chiropractic, with the reasoning left visible.</h1>
	<p class="lede">
		Chiropractic Nerd is building a public, revisable model that connects
		philosophy, science, and art with real-world practice. Version 0.1 is a
		first pass. The goal is to make the reasoning visible early, learn from
		what survives scrutiny, and refine the model as we go.
	</p>
	<div class="hero-actions">
		<a class="button" href="/articles/toward-a-coherent-model-of-chiropractic/">
			Start here: Read the introduction →
		</a>
		<a class="button secondary" href="/model/">Explore Model v0.1 →</a>
	</div>
	<p class="action-note">
		New to the project? The introduction explains why the model exists and how to read it.
		If you already have the context, you can go directly to the model.
	</p>
</Layout>
